{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive demo content included!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out <strong>18 maps</strong> and <strong>122 unique weapons</strong> in advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(The full release will feature even more content!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137580/extras/ef451021acbf49be2ec3d91d2fd53100.poster.avif?t=1762793884\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137580/extras/ef451021acbf49be2ec3d91d2fd53100.webm?t=1762793884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A round of physics comedy where everyone takes flight.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Head</strong> is a multiplayer party brawler for up to <strong>8 players</strong> who slip, grab, and throw one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short ~2-minute rounds and ever-changing gimmicks and supply drops keep the fun fresh every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beginners pick it up fast and quickly shout \u201cone more game.\u201d Enjoy the fast pace and light learning curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137580/extras/444dca167b3989a86a9803003f70fa1d.poster.avif?t=1762793884\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137580/extras/444dca167b3989a86a9803003f70fa1d.webm?t=1762793884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use the Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is packed with <strong>varied interactive elements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leverage the terrain to seize <strong>advantageous positions</strong>, and time your moves to <strong>grab items</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With smart positioning and a clutch play, go for the <strong>last one standing</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One choice can decide the match.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137580/extras/69040aa194903074572fcabc2260ad76.poster.avif?t=1762793884\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137580/extras/69040aa194903074572fcabc2260ad76.webm?t=1762793884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unpredictable Gimmicks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>zero-gravity</strong> moments to <strong>incoming cannon fire</strong>, a variety of gimmicks keeps you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them\u2014or avoid them\u2014and adapt your strategy on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small decision can trigger a chain reaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the flow and strike back; the laughs and cheers will be yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137580/extras/51303998e8aafc735e4f79c1afd7f6ee.poster.avif?t=1762793884\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137580/extras/51303998e8aafc735e4f79c1afd7f6ee.webm?t=1762793884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield <strong>152</strong> different weapons\u2014melee, ranged, and explosive\u2014to create fresh combinations every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some come with <strong>special effects</strong> that flip the battlefield in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Electrocute your foes</strong> or <strong>manipulate gravity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match spawns new combos; which weapon steals the spotlight is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137580/extras/6bfa03b5eac80b2ecd5266022d9fc113.poster.avif?t=1762793884\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137580/extras/6bfa03b5eac80b2ecd5266022d9fc113.webm?t=1762793884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It\u2019s Okay to Get Knocked Out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you\u2019re out, the show goes on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return in a <strong>ghost state</strong> and <strong>disrupt</strong> your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small prank can sway the momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting eliminated isn\u2019t the end\u2014find another way to get even.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4137580?t=1762793884","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4137580?t=1762793884","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137580/6ae84050c82a3be5e4b0d4a0d41dbaa9a883